@startuml
title UC-VIEW-001 查看个人工作记录 — 分析序列图
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
actor "普通成员" as A
boundary "接口:普通成员接口" as B
control "控制:查看个人工作记录控制" as C
participant "M:成员" as M
participant "L:工作量台账" as L
participant "W:成员周汇总" as W
A -> B: 查看个人工作记录(业务信息)
activate B
B -> C: 查看个人工作记录(业务信息)
activate C
C -> M: 验证业务资格(操作人、部门与职责)
M --> C: 资格结论
break 无权执行
  C --> B: 拒绝结果及原因
  B --> A: 拒绝结果及原因
end

C -> L: 查询个人工作量(本人、周次范围)
activate L
L -> W: 核对一致性(本人有效明细)
W --> L: 汇总、明细与异常
L --> C: 本人可访问工作记录
deactivate L

C --> B: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate C
B --> A: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate B
@enduml
